{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方两行大标题，白字与紫色强调词形成强对比；随后容易被左下方同样醒目的大字「这念头让他一阵心慌」吸引。两块大字共同争夺主视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，却说不清自己为什么想回去。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心慌、害怕、不敢继续想。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他究竟是舍不得曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是害怕孤单到愿意重新忍受那些气；以及他已经知道过去的自己经历过什么，却仍找不到简单答案。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块大字号文字都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"上方长句包含两种不同的回去动机，需要读完整句才能辨清。\",\n    \"核心处境与明确的心慌感分布在上下两个大字块中，需要拼接才能完整理解两者关系。\",\n    \"中间小字连续堆叠多行，进一步增加扫读时的信息竞争。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "71c76563-442d-4d9a-88f0-14f0a966edfe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013257303686Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:33:20.318837+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fc092cde183f0b992f6bfb98ca9487486ead7c472f038a6187d389c9152455d2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308c